A||||15||Cheever3000||Rick Mears' Fiero - the search is on!||||2||
Z||000000||Cheever3000||08-30-2001||06:27 PM||||Ever since Chadman posted this question on May 21, it has haunted me.<P>"Incidentally, every year, the Indy 500 winner gets the roadgoing equivalent of that year's pace car as part of his winnings. I know Bobby Rahal still has his '86 convertible Vette...<B>wonder if Rick Mears kept his Fiero?</B>"<P>I know others have asked the same question.  Last week I started searching & surfing.  Man, it's hard to find anything on Rick Mears!<P>Today the SCCA email'd me his home address, so I wrote a letter and gave it to the snail (USPS) to deliver.  Besides giving him my email addy, I told him we would be thrilled to have him come here and talk with us!  Cross your fingers.<P>I'll let you know if I hear anything more.<P><BR>------------------<BR><I>Ranger Chuck</I><BR><A HREF="http://home.houston.rr.com/fieropartsrelay" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Parts Relay</A> administrator<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever3000 (edited 08-30-2001).]||||reg||2
